iturgy of James.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Winkler, Gabriele. “A New Study of the Liturgy of James.” <title level="m">Orientalia Christiana Periodica</title> 80:1 (2014): 23–33.
